Subject: [PATCH 102/102] =?UTF-8?q?SystemUI:=20Bud=C3=ADk=20power=20menu?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"Napájení" card (export/mockups 09_power) with the battery level and a
2-column keycap grid (navy "Vypnout") replacing the power menu grid; all
keys go through the AOSP adapter. Adds "Pokročilý restart" (recovery,
bootloader, safe mode) which needs REBOOT and RECOVERY (platform signature).
No blur, no overflow menu.
---
 packages/SystemUI/AndroidManifest.xml         |   3 +
 .../systemui/globalactions/BudikPowerMenu.kt  | 367 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../GlobalActionsDialogLite.java              |  19 +-
 3 files changed, 388 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/globalactions/BudikPowerMenu.kt

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/AndroidManifest.xml b/packages/SystemUI/AndroidManifest.xml
